            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='18'>Assumptions / References</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>1. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>All Users Overview </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>is based on all new users acquired each month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>2. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>FDNC Incremental Impact Overview </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>is based on new users acquired due to FDNC, estimated based on the uplift in orders resulted in A/B testing.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>3. Retention rate is estimated based on the assumption that the new users would behave like non-incentivized users.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
